{"3976130": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Foes of Legacy: Survivors", "steam_appid": 3976130, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Arena of Ages Welcomes a New Warrior to Avalon!</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976130/extras/88dde7c23631c262ff38ed14c497ea84.poster.avif?t=1769249617\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976130/extras/88dde7c23631c262ff38ed14c497ea84.webm?t=1769249617\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976130/extras/88dde7c23631c262ff38ed14c497ea84.mp4?t=1769249617\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When spring arrives in the land of Avalon, the birds begin to sing and the first sparks of a legendary tale awaken.<br>Fensy, who has traveled long roads to claim the inheritance left to him, now faces ruthless enemies in an endless struggle.<br>Your choices will guide him through this battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Foes of Legacy</strong> is a rogue-like, 2D top-down action game where you must defend your inheritance while reacting quickly and strategically against relentless waves of enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Protect your legacy, collect XP and gold dropped by foes, and level up fast to become stronger. Unlock better weapons and gear to survive the bullet storm of Avalon and dive into an unforgettable indie adventure. Don’t leave Fensy alone in this fight—survive, strike back, and claim victory!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976130/extras/c1b14f6ac2b3ca8328e6e43df6c6bbab.poster.avif?t=1769249617\" width=854 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976130/extras/c1b14f6ac2b3ca8328e6e43df6c6bbab.webm?t=1769249617\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976130/extras/c1b14f6ac2b3ca8328e6e43df6c6bbab.mp4?t=1769249617\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>About the Game</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rogue-like 2D top-down adventure</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defend your inheritance, defeat enemies, gather XP and gold</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Level up quickly to unlock new weapons and gear</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive the bullet storm and strike back in Avalon’s unique indie adventure</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Quick Tips &amp; Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive through <strong>15 challenging waves</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each wave spawns <strong>random enemy encounters</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hundreds of weapon combinations: heavy, light, automatic, pistols, and melee</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Two playable characters, each with unique abilities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect dropped items and resources to purchase new gear</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick up gold and XP quickly—they will vanish if left behind</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple difficulty modes for every type of player</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976130/extras/aaceda44bc9503d13af98d7206fa7f02.poster.avif?t=1769249617\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976130/extras/aaceda44bc9503d13af98d7206fa7f02.webm?t=1769249617\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976130/extras/aaceda44bc9503d13af98d7206fa7f02.mp4?t=1769249617\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Arena of Ages Welcomes a New Warrior to Avalon!</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976130/extras/88dde7c23631c262ff38ed14c497ea84.poster.avif?t=1769249617\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976130/extras/88dde7c23631c262ff38ed14c497ea84.webm?t=1769249617\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3976130/extras/88dde7c23631c262ff38ed14c497ea84.mp4?t=1769249617\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When spring arrives in the land of Avalon, the birds begin to sing and the first sparks of a legendary tale awaken.<br>Fensy, who has traveled long roads to claim the inheritance left to him, now faces ruthless enemies in an endless struggle.<br>Your choices will guide him through this battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Foes of Legacy</strong> is a rogue-like, 2D top-down action game where you must defend your inheritance while reacting quickly and strategically against relentless waves of enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Protect your legacy, collect XP and gold dropped by foes, and level up fast to become stronger. Unlock better weapons and gear to survive the bullet storm of Avalon and dive into an unforgettable indie adventure. Don’t leave Fensy alone in this fight—survive, strike back, and claim victory!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinl